.TH batten-receipt-clean 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-receipt\-clean \- Refuse when the working tree differs from HEAD, so a receipt keyed to HEAD would attest bytes no commit contains
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten receipt clean\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse when the working tree differs from HEAD, so a receipt keyed to HEAD would attest bytes no commit contains
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
